# The generated Prisma client.
#
# Both the migrator and builder stages run `prisma generate` themselves, so this is
# produced inside the image and must never arrive from the build context. A copy that
# does arrive is at best redundant and at worst fatal: `prisma generate` refuses to
# write into a directory that "exists and is not empty but doesn't look like a
# generated Prisma Client", which is exactly what a partial or stale copy looks like.
src/generated

# Load test working files — generated credentials and results. Never needed in an image.
loadtest/accounts
loadtest/results
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
README.md
Dockerfile
